{"text": "Suddenly there was a quiet knock at the front door, so soft that the old man hardly heard it. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The match in his hand went out, and when a second knock came, he hurried back to the bedroom. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> It is Herbert, cried Missus White, running toward the stairs, I forgot that the cemetery was two miles away. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Her husband held her arm and begged her not to open the door, but she pulled herself away. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Hurrying down the stairs, she tried to pull back the heavy bolt, which was too high for her to reach. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Meanwhile, the old man was on his hands and knees, searching the dark floor for the monkeys paw. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The knocks grew louder and louder, and he heard his wife drag a chair to the door. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Just as the bolt began to slide back, he found the paw and made his third and last wish. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> At that very moment the knocking stopped, though its sound still seemed to echo through the house. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The door opened, and a cold wind rushed in, but the street lamp shone only on a quiet, empty road.", "alignment": {"characters": ["S", "u", "d", "d", "e", "n", "l", "y", " ", "t", "h", "e", "r", "e", " ", "w", "a", "s", " ", "a", " ", "q", "u", "i", "e", "t", " ", "k", "n", "o", "c", "k", " ", "a", "t", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "f", "r", "o", "n", "t", " ", "d", "o", "o", "r", ",", " ", "s", "o", " ", "s", "o", "f", "t", " ", "t", "h", "a", "t", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "o", "l", "d", " ", "m", "a", "n", " ", "h", "a", "r", "d", "l", "y", " ", "h", "e", "a", "r", "d", " ", "i", "t", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "T", "h", "e", " ", "m", "a", "t", "c", "h", " ", "i", "n", " ", "h", "i", "s", " ", "h", "a", "n", "d", " ", "w", "e", "n", "t", " ", "o", "u", "t", ",", " ", "a", "n", "d", " ", "w", "h", "e", "n", " ",